sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant M as Monitoring
  participant O as On-call + runbook
  participant D as Standby PostgreSQL
  participant W as Temporal Cloud
  participant S as Standby AegisDesk
  participant T as Traffic manager
  M->>O: Primary cloud unhealthy (probes fail, SLO burn)
  Note over O: Declare the disaster (a human decision)
  O->>D: Fence the old primary, promote the replica
  Note over W: Namespace fails over (automatic with HA)
  O->>S: Scale API and workers to full capacity
  S->>D: Readiness: database ok
  S->>W: Workers poll task queues · approvals continue
  O->>T: Shift traffic to the standby cloud
  T-->>S: User traffic
  Note over O,T: Record the achieved RTO and RPO, then plan failback
